#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-C expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "BASECA1N is legitimate in a BDS dataset, and this half of the AD0252 split is scoped to SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET only, so Scope.Data_Structures skips the rule before it executes. Pins that this half of the split is subject-level only. The declared structure=BDS wins over the column heuristic (Fix #154), carried by the mandatory #library block."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col AVAL     type=Num
col BASECA1N type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 12.5 | 1
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALT | 14.0 | 2
